     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet reason-for-family-planning-visit-values</b></p><a name=\"reason-for-family-planning-visit-values\"> </a><a name=\"hcreason-for-family-planning-visit-values\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/169450001\">169450001</a></td><td>Stopping contraception</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/408968008\">408968008</a></td><td>Contraception counseling</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/243816001\">243816001</a></td><td>Contraceptive continuation</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/275813002\">275813002</a></td><td>Emergency contraception</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/424016000\">424016000</a></td><td>Contraception Method switch</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 2019-covid-expanded has been used\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\"> version ⏿2019-covid-expanded</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30.460\">Z30.0</a></td><td>Contraception counseling</td><td>General counselling and advice on contraception</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30.4601\">Z30.01</a></td><td>Starting contraception</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30\">Z30</a></td><td>Contraceptive continuation</td><td>Contraceptive management</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30.46012\">Z30.012</a></td><td>Emergency contraception</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30.4640\">Z30.40</a></td><td>Contraception Issues and concerns</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30.4646\">Z30.46</a></td><td>Implant removal</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z30.46432\">Z30.432</a></td><td>IUD Removal</td><td/></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA 27921-8/\">LA 27921-8</a></td><td>Emergency contraception</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
